    "project": "research/semaev_symmetry_audit_20261113/lean",
    "theorem": "SemaevSymmetryAudit.actual_all_input_symmetry_with_control",
    "statement": "theorem actual_all_input_symmetry_with_control : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) (n : ℕ), (canonicalMv W n).IsSymmetric ∧ towerEquiv K (n+3) (canonicalMv W n) = fullInputEquiv K n (recursivePolynomial W n) ∧ (∀ σ : Equiv.Perm (Fin (n+3)), permuteCanonical K n σ (recursivePolynomial W n) = recursivePolynomial W n) ∧ (∀ (σ : Equiv.Perm (Fin (n+3))) (i : Fin (n+3)), permuteCanonical K n σ (inputVariable K n i) = inputVariable K n (σ i)) ∧ (∀ (σ : Equiv.Perm (Fin (n+3))) (a : K), permuteCanonical K n σ (C (coefficientEmbedding n a)) = C (coefficientEmbedding n a)) ∧ inputVariable K n 0 = X) ∧ s4Ring (0 : ℚ) 0 0 1 0 1 2 3 ≠ s4Ring (0 : ℚ) 0 0 1 0 2 1 3",
    "decl_sha256": "e1cf85f56469b7026f00916b715e96b641f8d88609f633ca24b6bb76ec28f583",
    "scope": "Full actual canonical Semaev polynomial permutation symmetry at every arity>=3 over every field, for actual general-Weierstrass coefficients, without nonsingularity or characteristic restrictions for this polynomial identity. Actual original recursivePolynomial is transported through explicit InputRing/tower/MV ring equivalences; its literal MV image IsSymmetric is proved from all actual adjacent swaps and Mathlib finite adjacent-generator closure. Every permutation pulled back fixes the original polynomial, sends every explicit inputVariable(i) to inputVariable(sigma i), fixes all C(coefficientEmbedding n a) coefficient-field scalars, and identifies outer coordinate0withX. Actual S3/S4 bases, source-ordered block and inherited resultant naturality. Inherited direct rational independent-b S4 negative control; not a qualified source refutation. General arbitrary splits k>=3 and higher absolute irreducibility remain open; no new native experiment or execution assurance.",
